00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:23.690
So because of that, you can label
them as saturated, unsaturated,

00:00:23.869 --> 00:00:26.299
or super saturated solutions.

00:00:27.044 --> 00:00:31.064
And this is what I'd like to describe
as the Goldilocks issue when it comes

00:00:31.064 --> 00:00:36.324
to solutions, meaning that it's very
similar to that old nursery rhyme

00:00:36.625 --> 00:00:40.114
all about Goldilocks and the three
bears where she was trying all the

00:00:40.114 --> 00:00:44.724
different types of porridge that was
too hot, too cold, and just right.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:50.380
Well, it's very similar to that here as
well, where we have two concentrated,

00:00:50.810 --> 00:00:55.679
not concentrated enough and just right
is how we are going to be looking at

00:00:55.710 --> 00:01:00.640
concentrated solutions as well and how
that affects the chemistry behind them.

00:01:01.199 --> 00:01:04.060
So we're going to take a look at
this and look at the different types.

00:01:04.079 --> 00:01:07.160
We're going to learn how to read
the charts for how you can actually

00:01:07.260 --> 00:01:09.630
determine what type it is as well.

00:01:09.850 --> 00:01:13.039
And we'll go through many different
examples and demonstrations to help

00:01:13.039 --> 00:01:15.000
show you what these all look like.

00:01:15.595 --> 00:01:20.344
Alright, let's go take a look, and thank
you so much for stopping by, and let's

00:01:20.344 --> 00:01:22.594
go look at the next, next, uh, example.

00:01:27.925 --> 00:01:29.854
Solubility in the Goldilocks issue.

00:01:30.404 --> 00:01:34.085
So this is all about
describing how solutions work.

00:01:34.254 --> 00:01:40.594
If you remember, a solution is composed
of both a solute and the solvent.

00:01:40.675 --> 00:01:44.335
The solute was the minor part,
which is dissolved by the solvent,

00:01:44.405 --> 00:01:45.995
which is the major component.

00:01:45.995 --> 00:01:46.054
Alright.

00:01:46.725 --> 00:01:52.475
Now, depending on how much solute you
have, so in a way of like, how is it

