too sweet or is it too salty, right?

00:01:55.414 --> 00:01:58.285
When you're thinking of trying to
dissolve these different things will

00:01:58.285 --> 00:02:00.964
help you actually describe saturation.

00:02:01.545 --> 00:02:07.145
So the three types of saturation are all
about how much of a solute there are.

00:02:07.789 --> 00:02:12.230
I like to think of it in terms of if
you were to ever make, let's say, uh,

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:17.359
iced tea at home or maybe coffee, for
example, and if you make iced tea and

00:02:17.359 --> 00:02:22.329
you are added, let's say, add sugar to
