00:02:22.329 --> 00:02:24.280
like, oh, it's not quite sweet enough.

00:02:24.689 --> 00:02:31.279
That's an unsaturated solution, meaning
that the solution is holding less

00:02:31.369 --> 00:02:34.500
than its maximum amount of solute.

00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:36.140
Meaning you can add more.

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:37.549
It's possible to add more.

00:02:38.079 --> 00:02:43.790
So now it's all about what is the limit
