We'll show you how that's
exactly possible, right?

00:03:37.810 --> 00:03:39.959
How can you go above, right?

00:03:39.959 --> 00:03:44.100
Because usually when you're saturated,
if you add a more solid into it,

00:03:44.310 --> 00:03:45.989
it's just gonna precipitate out.

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:50.400
But there's a way to kind of trick the
molecules into being super saturated.

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:53.790
So this is all about not
concentrate, not concentrating,

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:55.150
being, being all the way at the top.

00:03:55.579 --> 00:04:02.449
So not concentrate enough concentrated
and way too concentrated is the bottom.

00:04:02.459 --> 00:04:06.380
So let's look at this a little
